  "title": "QA — field token inside a redirect URL",
  "description": "Internal QA fixture: proves resolvePostSubmitTokens percent-encodes field values in the 'url' context, so a submitted value cannot inject query parameters or take over the destination (open redirect). Not a gallery template.",
